data: {"id": "59df02208ea04813-thinking-layer-442", "run_id": "59df02208ea04813", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "fetch_runbook", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "<runbook>\n# Pod CrashLoopBackOffRuntime / 容器反复退出\n\n> Pod异常类型: CrashLoopBackOffRuntime | 典型状态: CrashLoopBackOff | 兼容分类: container_runtime\n\n## 状态识别\n- Pod 状态: `CrashLoopBackOff`\n- Last State: Terminated\n-", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789143790232}

