data: {"id": "59df02208ea04813-thinking-parallel_evidence-1871", "run_id": "59df02208ea04813", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 生命周期 & 配置\n- Pod `aiops-case-v10/workload` 当前 `phase=Running`，但容器状态为 `Waiting/CrashLoopBackOff`，`Ready=False`，重启次数 `17`。\n- `Last State`：`Terminated`，`Reason=Error`，**Exit Code=78**（非 137、非 0、非 OOMKilled）。\n- 容器启动 command 为一段 inline Python：读取环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`，若为 None 则打印 `\"APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing\"` 并 `sys.exit(78)`。\n- 容器 `Environment: <none>`：即该环境变量在 Pod 定义中**未设置**。\n- 资源限制：CPU 50m / 32Mi，无探针定义。\n\n### 事件\n- 仅见 `Back-off restarting failed co", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789143839723, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

